#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:5
#: 6dc12e1d6c464e96b195e45c600c7bf9
msgid "Building ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows with Make"
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 Make 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:7
#: a17f1fcef02d44afba0c1193139492f8
msgid ""
"This article shows how to build ArduPilot for APM2.x on Windows with *Make*."
msgstr "本文介绍如何在 Windows 上使用 *Make* 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:11
#: 27b8272771d543eea0c5aa36e7be7703
msgid ""
"The approach described here is useful if you want to :ref:`develop using "
"Eclipse <building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-windows>`. :ref:`Building ArduPilot "
"for APM2.x on Windows with Arduino <building-ardupilot-with-arduino-"
"windows>` shows an alternative method for building ArduPilot for APM2.x."
msgstr ""
"如果您想 :ref:`使用 Eclipse 开发 <building-apm2-with-eclipse-on-"
"windows>`，本文描述的方法很有用。:ref:`在 Windows 上使用 Arduino 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot "
"<building-ardupilot-with-arduino-windows>` 展示了另一种为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot 的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:16
#: a486bac32bc246cdaf2fe747de694799
msgid ""
"Copter 3.3 firmware (and later) and builds after Plane 3.4.0 no longer fit "
"on APM boards. Plane, Rover and AntennaTracker builds can still be installed"
" at time of writing but you can no longer build APM2.x off the master branch"
" (you will need to build off a supported release branch, or for the keen "
"developer, from the AVR-master branch master-AVR and the tags from there.  "
"see: https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master-AVR )."
msgstr ""
"Copter 3.3 固件（及更高版本）以及 Plane 3.4.0 之后的构建不再适合 APM 开发板。撰写本文时，Plane、Rover 和 "
"AntennaTracker 的构建仍可安装，但您不能再从 master 分支构建 "
"APM2.x（您需要从受支持的发布分支构建，或对于有进取心的开发者，从 AVR-master 分支 master-AVR "
"及其标签构建，参见：https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master-AVR）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:22
#: 2e0809f79a334738817d6595d22de6dd
msgid ""
"The last Copter firmware that can be built on APM 2.x `can be downloaded "
"from here <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/archive/master-"
"AVR.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"可在 APM 2.x 上构建的最后一个 Copter 固件 `可从此处下载 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/archive/master-AVR.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:26
#: 8e0cea04b8c34982b141a5c113d7d5c1
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:28
#: 0536705b7271481595376260cee78923
msgid ""
"These instructions use the :ref:`PX4 Toolchain <building-px4-with-make>` "
"along with the :ref:`Arduino Tools <building-ardupilot-with-arduino-"
"windows>` to set up an environment in which you can build for APM2.x targets"
" with *make*. They have been tested on Windows 10 to build the "
"ArduCopter-3.2.1 branch."
msgstr ""
"这些说明使用 :ref:`PX4 Toolchain <building-px4-with-make>` 和 :ref:`Arduino Tools "
"<building-ardupilot-with-arduino-windows>` 搭建一个可以通过 *make* 为 APM2.x "
"目标构建的环境。已在 Windows 10 上通过构建 ArduCopter-3.2.1 分支进行了测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:35
#: 7a4fdee8a270408784f30bb7c8f96d44
msgid ""
"This article replaces previous instructions to use a basic `Cygwin "
"<http://www.cygwin.com/>`__ installation with the GNU sed, make and awk "
"packages installed. The pre-built environment from the PX4 Toolchain is a "
"lot easier to set up."
msgstr ""
"本文取代了之前使用安装了 GNU sed、make 和 awk 包的基础 `Cygwin <http://www.cygwin.com/>`__ "
"安装的说明。PX4 Toolchain 的预构建环境设置起来简单得多。"

