#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:139
#: 6841ff1addd545d39b84c719b3184c4f
msgid "Hints for speeding up compile time"
msgstr "加快编译速度的提示"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:141
#: 23c1cfa07b734907b9a97d758c901fb7
msgid ""
"Anti virus protection is likely to slow the compile times especially for "
"Pixhawk so it is recommended that the folders containing the ArduPilot "
"source code is excluded from your virus protections real-time scan."
msgstr ""
"杀毒软件保护可能会显著降低编译速度，尤其是对于 Pixhawk，因此建议将包含 ArduPilot 源代码的文件夹从病毒保护实时扫描中排除。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-for-apm2-x-on-windows-with-make.rst:145
#: b18a7a21de214eae9f8855ae12fba6d3
msgid ""
"The first scan after a ``make px4-clean`` will be very slow as it rebuilds "
"everything"
msgstr "执行 ``make px4-clean`` 后的第一次扫描速度会很慢，因为需要重新构建所有内容"
